<title>USA: American Federation of Teachers chief Albert Shanker.</title>
<headline>American Federation of Teachers chief Albert Shanker.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albert Shanker, president of the American Federation of Teachers, died of Cancer Saturday in New York, a spokesman for the union said.</p>
<p>Shanker, 68, who was elected president of the AFT in 1974, died at the Sloan-Kettering cancer center.</p>
